On this facet, Devi Prasad Sharma vs. State of Sikkim and Others it is essential to reproduce hereinbelow Paragraph 6 of the averments in the Plaint;
"6. That the brother of the Plaintiff Shri Gopal Prasad Sharma (Proforma Defendant)
is a government employee currently ranked as Divisional Engineer under the Social Welfare Department, Government of Sikkim.
